---
const components = [
  "Go API 服务",
  "React SPA 前端",
  "SQLite / MySQL / PostgreSQL",
  "JS 插件引擎",
  "主题系统",
  "CLI 管理工具",
  "noVNC 控制台",
  "Swagger 文档",
];

const platforms = [
  "Ubuntu", "Debian", "CentOS", "Rocky", "Alma",
  "Fedora", "openSUSE", "Alpine", "NixOS", "Void", "Chimera",
];
---

<section id="deploy" class="overflow-hidden bg-depth px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">

      <!-- 左侧：终端 + 说明 -->
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-light" data-animate>Deploy</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl" data-animate style="--stagger:.06s">
          一个二进制，装下所有
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-lg text-slate-400" data-animate style="--stagger:.12s">
          Go + React 编译为单个可执行文件。不需要 Docker，不需要 Nginx，不需要 Node.js。下载、运行，就这么简单。
        </p>

        <!-- 终端 -->
        <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 ring-1 ring-white/10" data-animate="left" style="--stagger:.18s">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-5 py-3">
            <span class="h-[10px] w-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]/70"></span>
            <span class="h-[10px] w-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]/70"></span>
            <span class="h-[10px] w-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#28c840]/70"></span>
            <span class="ml-4 font-mono text-[0.7rem] text-slate-500">Terminal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4 break-all p-6 font-mono text-[0.82rem] leading-relaxed">
            <div>
              <div class="text-slate-500"># 下载</div>
              <div class="text-slate-200">
                <span class="text-emerald-400">$</span> wget https://github.com/huohuastudio/novaix-releases/releases/latest/download/<wbr/>novaix_linux_amd64.tar.gz
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-slate-500"># 解压</div>
              <div class="text-slate-200">
                <span class="text-emerald-400">$</span> tar -xzf novaix_linux_amd64.tar.gz
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-slate-500"># 启动</div>
              <div class="text-slate-200">
                <span class="text-emerald-400">$</span> ./novaix_linux_amd64/novaix
              </div>
              <div class="mt-1 space-y-0.5 text-slate-400">
                <div><span class="text-slate-500">15:04:05</span> <span class="text-cyan-400">INF</span> Novaix 启动中 <span class="text-slate-500">version=</span>v1.6.0</div>
                <div><span class="text-slate-500">15:04:05</span> <span class="text-cyan-400">INF</span> 插件加载完成 <span class="text-slate-500">total=</span>12 <span class="text-slate-500">valid=</span>12</div>
                <div><span class="text-slate-500">15:04:05</span> <span class="text-cyan-400">INF</span> 服务器启动中 <span class="text-slate-500">addr=</span>:8080</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 右侧：二进制组成 + 平台支持 -->
      <div class="space-y-10">
        <!-- 体积对比 -->
        <div data-animate="right" style="--stagger:.1s">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">体积对比</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
            <div>
              <div class="mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
                <span>传统方案</span>
                <span>Nginx + Node.js + Database + ...</span>
              </div>
              <div class="h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800">
                <div class="h-full w-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-600 to-slate-500"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
                <span>Novaix</span>
                <span class="text-brand-light">~30MB 单文件</span>
              </div>
              <div class="h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800">
                <div class="h-full w-[15%] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-brand to-brand-light"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 包含组件 -->
        <div data-animate="right" style="--stagger:.2s">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">一个文件包含</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {components.map((c) => (
              <span class="rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">
                {c}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 支持平台 -->
        <div data-animate="right" style="--stagger:.3s">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">节点操作系统</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {platforms.map((p) => (
              <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.06] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-slate-400">{p}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-signal"></span>
              x86_64
            </span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-signal"></span>
              ARM64
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 在线更新 -->
        <div data-animate="right" style="--stagger:.4s">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">在线更新</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            后台一键升级，自动备份、迁移、替换。SQLite 迁移失败自动回滚。支持 MySQL 和 PostgreSQL。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
